.md
## `Deploy` support
The Wolfram Language `Deploy` wrapper now works with any decorated expression. It:
- traverses the full expression tree
- makes the expression non-selectable and non-editable

A typical use case is constructing a GUI with `Panel`, `Row`, and `Grid` blocks:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## `Deploy` support
The Wolfram Language `Deploy` wrapper now works with any decorated expression. It:
- traverses the full expression tree
- makes the expression non-selectable and non-editable

A typical use case is constructing a GUI with `Panel`, `Row`, and `Grid` blocks:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Row[{
  Graphics[{Red, Disk[]}, ImageSize->{18,18}, PlotRange->2], 
  Style["Hey there", (*VB[*)(RGBColor[0.3333333333333333, 0.3333333333333333, 0.3333333333333333])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNiYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcEsQBHn4PCQNGaQPAeQCHJ3cs7PyS8qCgWDq/aYDABERxdN"*)(*]VB*)]
}, Alignment->{{Right, Left},Center}, ImageSize->400] // Deploy

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*GB[*){{(*VB[*)(Graphics[{RGBColor[1, 0, 0], Disk[{0, 0}]}, ImageSize -> {18, 18}, PlotRange -> 2])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KWnMIB4HkHAvSizIyEwuTmOCyftkFpcg5IPcnZzzc/KLMkH6MxlgBMI4l8zibFTNSKrg4kGlOanFnECGZ25iempwZlUqmh4hkB4h7HoCcvJLghLz0lMzQXIAEh0ltg=="*)(*]VB*)(*|*),(*|*)(*BB[*)("Hey there")(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNiYGAo5gcSAUX5ZZkpqSn+BSWZ+XnFaYwgCT4gEVxSmZPqkpqcX5RYkl+UxgwS5wASQe5Ozvk5+UVFoWBw1R6TATGdBaS4NCc1mA1sWlFmXjpYLKSoNBUAbPgknA=="*)(*]BB*)}}(*||*)(*1:eJxdTlsKAjEQq+IDBcEreBQfKIJfW/C/u07rQB/Q6bLiKTyyUxWk/RmSTBKyaUOjJ0IIWvG5IgwH6EJUKUSZ5VPEmx7nf2ZNb4HWP3kXHluLxjvw6W+5IKUyIOcM9sH2zlPpo2m2oLmnrwS6jn5AGEiPiv6C0Sz38wiI1dIFg7NTBiQ+AV+cqgxLBhIsdEm1TPOco7IEb0vbPq8=*)(*]GB*)

