.md
## Fixed bugs
- [x] `Animate`, `Refresh`, `Manipulate` major bugs related to JIT-unsupported data structures and formatting
- [x] JIT transpiler (`Manipulate` and etc) fails on `VertexTextureCoordinates`
- [x] JIT transpiler fails silently when `VertexColors` is `RGBColor` list instead of converting it to plain triples of numbers
- [x] JIT transpiler silently overwrites its own table with `$Failed`
- [x] JIT transpiler converts 2D polygons incorrectly (replaces with lines - a typo)   
- [x] **Insert Matrix** snippet is broken
- [x] `Transparent` is unsupported in the context of 2D and 3D graphics
- [x] Invisible text selection 
- [x] Minor bugs related to MCP server and CLI
- [x] `CreateWindow` event generation issues
- [x] `InputTerminal` always adds `\n` character
- [x] Accent colors are not reflected in separators 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Fixed bugs
- [x] `Animate`, `Refresh`, `Manipulate` major bugs related to JIT-unsupported data structures and formatting
- [x] JIT transpiler (`Manipulate` and etc) fails on `VertexTextureCoordinates`
- [x] JIT transpiler fails silently when `VertexColors` is `RGBColor` list instead of converting it to plain triples of numbers
- [x] JIT transpiler silently overwrites its own table with `$Failed`
- [x] JIT transpiler converts 2D polygons incorrectly (replaces with lines - a typo)   
- [x] **Insert Matrix** snippet is broken
- [x] `Transparent` is unsupported in the context of 2D and 3D graphics
- [x] Invisible text selection 
- [x] Minor bugs related to MCP server and CLI
- [x] `CreateWindow` event generation issues
- [x] `InputTerminal` always adds `\n` character
- [x] Accent colors are not reflected in separators 

%------------------------------%EndOfCells%-------------------------------%



